  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.6.5 - New EditDatePicker/EditDateRange form-bound calendar pickers; DatePicker/DateRangePicker gained a weekday header, month nav, and keyboard grid navigation. Bug fixes: Table sortable-header TitleContent no longer nests a button-in-button and keeps the indeterminate checkbox state across styled/unstyled swaps; DateRangePicker range-commit/preset/year-select fixes; edit-controls.js invalid-field selector no longer over-matches; JsInteropEc degrades gracefully without the WssEditControls global; wss-overlay.js scroll-lock/focus-trap state is now shared across module instances. See the README changelog for details.",
